Verified accounts allow sending and receiving larger payments. Users can link bank accounts and credit cards easily. They also avoid sudden account holds or limitations. Businesses can accept payments without delays. Verified accounts improve credibility with buyers and sellers.&lt;br&gt;
Risks To Consider&lt;br&gt;
